  <summary>Serverless, end-to-end-encrypted peer-to-peer LAN chat</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Vartalaap is a serverless, end-to-end-encrypted chat app for the local
      network. Peers discover each other automatically over the LAN and talk
      directly, with every message and file end-to-end encrypted. No servers,
      no accounts, no cloud.
    </p>
